# Local Claude Code config, not shared with the repo
/CLAUDE.md

# Compiled binaries and packaged apps — produced by `go build`, `fyne
# package`, and the release CI. These are release artifacts (or built and
# tested in the pipeline), never committed. Patterns are anchored to the
# repo root with a leading `/` so they don't shadow the same-named source
# packages under cmd/ (e.g. cmd/confluence-to-markdown/).
/confluence-to-markdown
/confluence-to-markdown-*
/*.exe
/*.app/
/dist/
*.test

# OS junk
.DS_Store
